Comm. from R.W. Healy re:
a.) Lease of commercial space in the East Cambridge Garage and;
b.) Adoption of a designated tenant.

181F Approval of the tax rate for FY96:

A. Authorize the use of $5,778,000 in the Unreserved Fund Balance (Free Cash) to offset the following FY1996 expenditures: Operating Budget $1,500,000 (as adopted in FY 1996 Budget); Capital Budget $1,820,000 (as adopted in FY1996 Budget); Overlay Reserve $1,188,000; Salary Adjustment $1,270,000;

B. Appropriate $3,215,000 to the Salary Adjustment account to cover the cost of employee contract settlement;

C. Classify property into the five classes;

D. Adopt a minimum residential factor of 56.32730%

E. Vote to approve the maximum residential exemption of 20% for owner occupied homes;

F. Vote to double the normal value of statutory exemptions for FY1996; and

G. Vote to double the income limit for deferral of property taxes by elderly homeowners.
